higher taxes, and increased living costs.
</p>
</div>

<div class="sim-card">
<h3>Growth Economy</h3>
<p>
Rapid development creates opportunities
for entrepreneurs and early adopters.
</p>
</div>

<div class="sim-card">
<h3>Remote Economy</h3>
<p>
Earn income globally while choosing
locations based on lifestyle and affordability.
</p>
</div>

</div>

<h2 class="section-title">Strategist Thinking</h2>

<div class="questions">

<div class="question-box">
