</div>

<h2 class="section-title">Historical Pattern Library</h2>

<div class="timeline">

<div class="timeline-item">
<h3>Industrial Revolution</h3>
<p>
Technology transformed productivity and created entirely new industries.
</p>
</div>

<div class="timeline-item">
<h3>Information Age</h3>
